local-10: M-RoPE cos/sin cache sized like plain RoPE (vLLM #59853, in v0.32.0)

Qwen3.8 built its M-RoPE cache at 4x max_position_embeddings (headroom only
video pruning needs; video is off on these slugs). Measured on sm_86 with the
Swift config (rotary dim 64, 262,144 positions): cache held per GPU 128 -> 32 MiB,
build peak 644 -> 161 MiB, first 262,144 rows bit-exact. Upstream diff as-is
except the qwen4_exp qsa.py import hunk, re-anchored for the patched tree.
Drop when the image moves to vLLM >= 0.32.

